abstract: >-
  Analysis code reproducing every number, table and figure in a triangulation study of IL-6
  signalling, hepcidin-mediated iron restriction and neonatal bilirubin metabolism. The code
  covers three evidence layers: two neonatal clinical cohorts (MIMIC-IV v1.0 and MIMIC-III
  v1.4), genetic analyses (cis-pQTL Mendelian randomisation and colocalisation for IL6R and the
  HAMP locus), and human hepatocyte transcriptomes from GEO. MIMIC data are access-controlled
  and are not redistributed; the clinical scripts require a local PostgreSQL instance holding
  the MIMIC schemas.
